Third-party / derived material
==============================

- configs/bluetooth/main.conf is a backup of a BlueZ main configuration file.
  BlueZ is licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later. The file is included as a
  configuration backup; custom values are documented in README.md.

- configs/input-remapper/Bluetooth Keyboard/general.json is a user
  input-remapper preset, included as a configuration backup.

- The Linux kernel hid-samsung driver is referenced in docs/keyboard-notes.md
  but is not included in this repository. It is licensed under
  GPL-2.0-or-later.

- The GPLv3 license text in LICENSE is from the GNU project:
  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html

No link keys, Bluetooth bonding keys, or MAC addresses from the original
machine are included. The scripts require a local, gitignored config.env.
